# Workflow: Task > New

Creates a standalone task file for ad-hoc work with structured TDD or non-TDD development paths.

<workflow>

<step n="1" goal="Initialize Task & Choose Development Approach">
  <action>**Prompt for Task Details:**
  - Task description/requirements
  - Choose development approach: TDD (with tests first) or Direct (implement then test)
  - Estimate complexity (small/medium/large)</action>

  <action>**Create Task File:**
  - From: `plans/templates/task.md` (if exists) or use standard format
  - To: `plans/tasks/TASK-YYYYMMDD-<slug>.md`
  - Include: title, date, status, description, approach, complexity</action>

  <action>**Set Context:**
  - Update `~/.slopdog/plans/context.yaml` with `execution.current_task`
  - Add initial log entry</action>

  <output>
    ✅ **Ending Step 1: Initialize Task & Choose Development Approach**
    📝 Created task file: `plans/tasks/TASK-YYYYMMDD-<slug>.md`
    🎯 Approach selected: [TDD/Direct]

    ➡️ **Beginning Step 2: Requirements & Planning**
  </output>
</step>

<step n="2" goal="Requirements & Planning">
  <action>**Define Clear Requirements:**
  - Break down into specific, testable deliverables
  - Add acceptance criteria if applicable
  - Identify dependencies or prerequisites</action>

  <action>**Plan Implementation:**
  - List files that will be created/modified
  - Consider edge cases and error handling
  - Plan testing approach</action>

  <output>
    ✅ **Ending Step 2: Requirements & Planning**
    📋 Requirements defined and documented
    🗂️ Implementation plan created

    ➡️ **Beginning Step 3: [TDD Path: Red Test / Direct Path: Implementation]**
  </output>
</step>

<step n="3a" goal="TDD Path: Create Failing Test (Red)" condition="TDD approach selected">
  <critical>This is the FIRST engineering step for TDD. Do not write implementation code yet.</critical>

  <action>**Create Failing Test:**
  - Location: `tests/` (unit) or `tests/e2e/` (integration)
  - Test must FAIL on current codebase (red state)
  - Cover the expected behavior from requirements</action>

  <action>**Document Test:**
  - Add test description to task file
  - Link to test file location</action>

  <check if="test passed unexpectedly">
    <critical>The test PASSED but should have FAILED. Do not proceed.</critical>
    <action>Refine the test case to correctly test the new functionality.</action>
  </check>

  <output>
    ✅ **Ending Step 3a: TDD Path: Create Failing Test (Red)**
    🔴 Created failing test (Red state confirmed)
    📋 Test documented in task

    ➡️ **Beginning Step 4a: TDD Implementation (Green)**
  </output>
</step>

<step n="3b" goal="Direct Path: Implementation" condition="Direct approach selected">
  <action>**Implement Feature:**
  - Write minimal code to satisfy requirements
  - Follow established patterns and conventions
  - Add appropriate error handling</action>

  <action>**Log Progress:**
  - Update task file with implementation details
  - Track files created/modified</action>

  <output>
    ✅ **Ending Step 3b: Direct Path: Implementation**
    💻 Feature implemented
    📝 Progress logged

    ➡️ **Beginning Step 4b: Testing & Verification**
  </output>
</step>

<step n="4a" goal="TDD Implementation (Green)" condition="TDD approach selected">
  <action>**Write Minimal Code:**
  - Implement just enough code to make the test pass
  - Avoid over-engineering (prototype bias)
  - Refactor only if necessary for clarity</action>

  <action>**Verify Test Passes:**
  - Run the test created in Step 3a
  - Ensure it now passes (green state)</action>

  <check if="test still fails">
    <action>Debug and fix the implementation.</action>
    <action>Re-run test until it passes.</action>
  </check>

  <output>
    ✅ **Ending Step 4a: TDD Implementation (Green)**
    🟢 Test now passes (Green state confirmed)
    💻 Minimal implementation complete

    ➡️ **Beginning Step 5: Final Testing & Refinement**
  </output>
</step>

<step n="4b" goal="Testing & Verification" condition="Direct approach selected">
  <action>**Add Tests:**
  - Create unit tests for core logic
  - Add integration tests if applicable
  - Test edge cases and error conditions</action>

  <action>**Manual Testing:**
  - Verify functionality works as expected
  - Test with different inputs/data</action>

  <check if="tests fail or issues found">
    <action>Fix implementation issues.</action>
    <action>Re-test until all tests pass.</action>
  </check>

  <output>
    ✅ **Ending Step 4b: Testing & Verification**
    ✅ All tests pass
    🔍 Manual testing complete

    ➡️ **Beginning Step 5: Final Testing & Refinement**
  </output>
</step>

<step n="5" goal="Final Testing & Refinement">
  <action>**Run Full Test Suite:**
  - Ensure no regressions in existing functionality
  - Check for console errors, linting issues
  - Verify on different environments if applicable</action>

  <action>**Code Review:**
  - Self-review for code quality
  - Check adherence to style guide
  - Ensure documentation is updated</action>

  <action>**Update Task Status:**
  - Mark as completed in task file
  - Add final log entries
  - Update context.yaml if needed</action>

  <output>
    ✅ **Ending Step 5: Final Testing & Refinement**
    🧪 Full test suite passes
    🔍 Code review complete
    ✅ Task marked as completed

    ➡️ **Beginning Step 6: Summary & Handoff**
  </output>
</step>

<step n="6" goal="Summary & Handoff">
  <action>**Compile Summary:**
  Provide a final structured summary confirming workflow completion.</action>

  <output>
    ### ✅ Task Completion Summary

    **1. Task Overview**
    - **Title:** [Task title]
    - **Approach:** [TDD/Direct]
    - **Complexity:** [Small/Medium/Large]

    **2. Implementation Details**
    - **Files Created/Modified:** [List]
    - **Key Changes:** [Summary]

    **3. Testing Approach**
    - [x] TDD: Red → Green cycle (if TDD selected)
    - [x] Direct: Implementation → Testing (if Direct selected)
    - [x] Full test suite passes
    - [x] No regressions introduced

    **4. Quality Gates**
    - [x] Code style guide followed
    - [x] Documentation updated
    - [x] Console errors: Verified ZERO (0)

    **5. Artifacts**
    - Task: `[Link to Task File]`
    - Status: **Completed**
  </output>
</step>

</workflow>
